This project derives its RunPod worker behavior from RunPod's worker-comfyui
version 5.8.6:

https://github.com/runpod-workers/worker-comfyui

This derivative replaces the generic request and output handling with a
MiniMax H3 contract. It reads one image and one video from private,
volume-backed paths and publishes the selected MP4 output to a private network
volume path. These modifications do not make input or output media public.
